# The build sees only the server's and the page's sources (Dockerfile): never the game folder, gen/ (the lifted
# game code), out/ (the game module) or anything else of this checkout.  A list of what may go in, not of what
# may not.
*
!app/registry-defaults.txt
!web/package.json
!web/package-lock.json
!web/build.mjs
!web/index.html
!web/src/
!web/server/
